msgctxt "64"
msgid "That guy a pal of yours, Kiryu-chan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "More like a brother. I haven't known him for long, but he's a good guy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"I could get my boys out searchin' for him if ya want. They got peepers like "
"hawks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"If it wouldn't be too much trouble. Let me know if anything\r\n"
"comes up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "You know me, Kiryu-chan. I'll ring ya up even if it doesn't!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid "Majima"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
